---
import Medallions from "./Medallions.astro";

const CREDENTIALS = [
  "Official Louisiana Storyteller · Louisiana Economic Development",
  "Member, The National Society of Collegiate Scholars (NSCS)",
  "Chief Brand Officer, FlightTime Athletics LLC",
  "M.S. Entertainment Business Candidate · Full Sail University, 2027",
  "B.S. Music Business · Full Sail University",
];
---

<section id="about" class="border-y border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 py-24">
  <div class="container-page grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start" data-reveal-group>
    <div>
      <p class="lead-label text-electricBlue">About</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-black sm:text-5xl">
        Louisiana is not a market to me. It is a proving ground.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">
        Credentials earned on the ground in Louisiana and in the classroom at Full Sail University.
        Each medallion below is a standing proof point behind the strategy work.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8" data-reveal>
        <Medallions />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
        I am Jaylen Sinegal, an executive brand strategist and media IP consultant from Lafayette,
        Louisiana. I have worked in local publishing, built live entertainment events, run youth
        performance programming, and studied music business and entertainment law. I look at the
        system around the thing: the athlete, the school, the event, the sponsor, the story, and the
        rights attached to all of it.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
        My work helps athletes, families, schools, and businesses protect their intellectual
        property, stay ahead of compliance, and build brands that survive on their own terms. I
        build the strategy; FlightTime Athletics operates the athlete-performance ecosystem. If you
        need an agent to negotiate contracts or secure employment, that is not my lane. If you want
        to understand your rights, your content, and your brand, that is exactly where I work.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3">
        {
          CREDENTIALS.map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm font-bold text-neutral-700">
              <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-electricBlue" aria-hidden="true" />
              {item}
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>